才の魔法使いで、炎の魔法が得意です。\n性格は真面目で、天才の子より性格は大人びています。\n趣味は読書で、常に魔法の勉強をする努力家です。\n\n構図は、二人の日常的な風景か、二人で魔法の練習をする様子をお願い致します！\n日常風景の方は指定が抽象的ですが、お好きに描いていただければと思います。\n\nお忙しいところ大変恐縮ではございますが、リクエストにお答えいただけると大変うれしく思います。\nよろしくお願いいたします！\n\n【参考資料】\nhttps://twitter.com/tamasuke_kr/status/1463392079271247874?s=20\nhttps://twitter.com/ikiru1214/status/1462913479921127424?s=20\nhttps://twitter.com/tamasuke_kr/status/1462815229801209861?s=20", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1159004, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ボルボックス", "screen_name": "microbe_volvox", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2066529598712754176/DyOCRkhl.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2843427408/1775475824/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 1360159, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "46", "screen_name": "Shino_BunnYs", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1815956782935928832/DYJXAUQ6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/961537912008409088/1518162142/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 2182033, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "白猫のシオン", "screen_name": "shionshironeko2", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1546500203523387392/BxPOSgKV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_